    },
    {
      "Text": "An open source implementation of SSH protocol version 2\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nIn ssh-agent in OpenSSH before 10.5, some operations can occur remotely but were intended to occur only locally, including operations that add tokens or use keys. This is caused by misinteraction between agent locking and the (CVE-2026-73281)",
