      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for openssh is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of low. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
